        <span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">In the design phase, you have already encountered theoretical insights into the transdisciplinary learning process, including an overview of possible working methods. Now these ideas must be put into practice. You need to make choices and start testing.</span>
      </span>
